criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Male or female aged ≥ 18 years and ≤ 75 years old;
* Subjects in primary prevention for cardiovascular diseases;
* Estimated 10-year cardiovascular risk \< 10%;
* Screening lipid levels meeting at least one of the following criteria:
* non-HDL cholesterol between 145 and 220 mg/dL, OR
* LDL cholesterol between 115 and 190 mg/dL;
* Subjects who have the capability to communicate, to make themselves understood, and to comply with the study's requirements;
* Subjects willing to participate in the study and having dated and signed the informed consent form.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Triglycerides \> 400 mg/dL at screening;
* Type 1 or type 2 diabetes mellitus;
* Current treatment with lipid-lowering drugs;
* Known clinically significant alterations of hepatic and/or renal function;
* Women of childbearing potential not using adequate contraceptive methods;
* Pregnancy and breastfeeding;
* Any medical or surgical condition that could make adherence to the protocol complex or inconsistent, or could compromise subject safety or the ability to complete the study;
* Known intolerance/hypersensitivity to any component of the investigational products.
